  "prefLabel": "En 3002.02 Aggregate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 3002.02 “Aggregate” means to combine the natural gas loads of 2 or more customers or a single customer with multiple meters or multiple locations.\n\nSource. #14593, eff 5-21-26, EXPIRES: 5-21-36",
